---
source: tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Manage advanced LanceDB-backed Sources (enable, sync, enrich, model, skill)

Usage: mf source advanced [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  enable         Activate LanceDB-backed Sources (imports all legacy registrations)
  sync           Reconcile content for all or selected Source registrations
  enrich         List, show, or apply Claude enrichment for shared Source content
  skill-install  Install the /mf-source Claude Code Skill into this repo
  status         Report aggregate status of the advanced Source index
  rebuild        Rebuild the entire LanceDB index from all live registrations
  clear          Clear derived content (documents, chunks, enrichments)
  recover        Recover the LanceDB pointer from a retained snapshot
  legacy         Manage legacy compatibility projections
  disable        Disable Lance backend and switch to legacy mode

Options:
      --root <PATH>      Mind Repo root directory
      --config <PATH>    Config file path
  -v, --verbose...       Verbose output
  -q, --quiet            Silence non-error output
  -o, --output <FORMAT>  Output format [default: text] [possible values: text, json]
      --json             Shorthand for --output json
      --no-color         Disable colored output
  -p, --project <NAME>   Project name for project-scoped operations
  -h, --help             Print help
  -V, --version          Print version
